<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Tarjeta NFC Disponible para Activar</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 viewBox=%220%22%20%220%22%20%22100%22%20%22100%22><text y=%22.9em%22 font-size=%2290%22>✨</text></svg>">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="mobile-viewport">
    <main class="mobile-card-container available-card">
      
      <!-- Radar animado NFC -->
      <div class="radar-circle">
        <svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 7 3 9 3 9H3s3-2 3-9" />
          <path d="M10.3 21a1.94 1.94 0 0 0 3.4 0" />
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="badge-card-id">ID Tarjeta: #<%= cardId %></div>

      <h1 class="business-title" style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem;">Tarjeta Disponible</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; line-height: 1.6;">
        Esta tarjeta física NFC / código QR está lista para ser asignada a un negocio local en Colombia.
      </p>

      <div style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; text-align: left; border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);">
        <h3 style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #38bdf8; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem;">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"></line></svg>
          ¿Eres el administrador o dueño del negocio?
        </h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-dim);">
          Accede al panel de administración para asociar tu Instagram, WhatsApp y enlace de Google Reviews a esta tarjeta.
        </p>
      </div>

      <a href="/admin?edit=<%= cardId %>" class="btn-primary">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M11 4H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-7"></path>
          <path d="M18.5 2.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L12 15l-4 1 1-4 9.5-9.5z"></path>
        </svg>
        Activar y Configurar Negocio
      </a>

      <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
        <a href="/admin" style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-dim); text-decoration: none;">
          &larr; Volver al Panel General
        </a>
      </div>

    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
